{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"InputImageSelectionStrategy"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before selecting the best quality image, a sequence of stable input images must be available. From this pool of input images,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the one with the highest quality is selected. An input image is considered stable if the image analysis results are consistent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"across consecutive stream of input images."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A larger pool size increases the likelihood of capturing a high-quality image but may introduce a slight delay,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as more stable input images need to be collected."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Available strategies are: "},{"code":"SingleImage","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"OptimizeForSpeed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"Balanced","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"OptimizeForQuality","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Default strategy represents a trade-off between speed and quality, while "},{"code":"OptimizeForSpeed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"OptimizeForQuality","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" represent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"strategies optimized for speed and quality, respectively."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This setting is applicable only for "},{"code":"Video","type":"codeVoice"}